aFq(a){return"Which holdings actually drove your return.\n\nFor each holding: its total P/L in "+a+" \u2014 realized and unrealized gains plus the dividends it paid \u2014 and that P/L as a share of your whole portfolio's cost basis. Because every holding uses the same denominator, the percentages ADD UP to your total return-on-cost (shown top-right).\n\n\"AAPL +4.2%\" means AAPL's gain equals 4.2% of everything you invested. Sorted by biggest mover (up or down). Holdings with an unavailable FX rate are excluded. Informational \u2014 changes no other figure."},
