aKN(a){return"Your good sells saved you "+a+" vs holding."},
gaKO(){return"Set cash"},
gaKP(){return"Add stocks to your Watchlist to see whether you should have bought them instead of (or in addition to) your current holdings."},
gaKQ(){return"Compares watched stocks' price returns since you started watching them against your portfolio's average price return (excluding dividends).\n\nBoth figures use price change only, so the comparison is like-for-like. Helps you see which stocks on your watchlist you missed out on \u2014 and whether sitting on the sidelines cost you."},
gaKR(){return"Compares watched stocks' returns since you started watching them against your portfolio's average return over the same period.\n\nHelps you see which stocks on your watchlist you missed out on \u2014 and whether sitting on the sidelines cost you."},
gaKS(){return"Sell or partially trim a stock to see whether you should have held those shares instead."},
gVe(){return"For each stock you've sold (fully or partially), shows what would have happened if you had kept holding those shares until today.\n\nCompares your actual sell price against the current price \u2014 so you can see your biggest regrets and your best exits.\n\nPartial exits show analysis for the shares already sold, independent of the remaining open position."},
